# the forms wiki/struct.md shows that wap does not build yet: each red line is a to-do, fixed by building the form
use "check.wap"

struct point{
  x:int
  y:int
}
check("a struct is built from its fields", point(1,2).y, 2)
class Spot{ x:int; y:int }
check("a class body may follow the name glued", Spot(1,2).y, 2)
